        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1932 年 1 月 28 日夜日军海军陆战队自虹口租界进攻闸北，第十九路军奋起抵抗。原线起点在长江口外，与事变无关；现改为虹口至闸北的防御段。",
          "en": "On the night of 28 January 1932 Japanese marines advanced from the Hongkou concession into Zhabei and the 19th Route Army resisted. The former line began outside the Yangtze estuary; it is now the Hongkou–Zhabei defence."
        },
