        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1937 年 9 月 25 日八路军第 115 师在灵丘至平型关之间的乔沟设伏，歼灭日军第 5 师团辎重部队。原线终点偏离乔沟 10 公里，现校正至伏击区。",
          "en": "On 25 September 1937 the 115th Division ambushed the Japanese 5th Division’s supply column at Qiaogou between Lingqiu and Pingxingguan. The former end lay 10 km off Qiaogou and is now corrected to the ambush area."
        },
