        "name": {
          "zh": "忻口会战（南怀化—大白水一线）",
          "en": "Xinkou battle (Nanhuaihua–Dabaishui line)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1937 年 10 月 13 日至 11 月 2 日中国军队在忻口至南怀化、大白水一线凭险坚守，与日军第 5 师团等部激战二十余日。原线作太原—代县，与战场不符；现改为忻口战场一线。",
          "en": "From 13 October to 2 November 1937 the Chinese army held the Xinkou–Nanhuaihua–Dabaishui line against the Japanese 5th Division for over twenty days. The former line ran Taiyuan–Daixian, which is not the battlefield; it is now the Xinkou line."
        },
