        "name": {
          "zh": "百团大战",
          "en": "Hundred Regiments Offensive"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1940 年 8 月 20 日八路军在正太、同蒲、平汉等线发动破袭战，第 129 师破袭正太路西段至榆次附近；1941 年 1 月 24 日反“扫荡”结束，百团大战告终。原线西端止于榆次以东且无锚点，现校正至榆次并补破袭事件。",
          "en": "On 20 August 1940 the Eighth Route Army attacked the Zhengding–Taiyuan, Tongpu and Pinghan railways, the 129th Division breaking the western Zhengding–Taiyuan section to the approaches of Yuci; the counter-sweep operations ended on 24 January 1941. The former western end lay east of Yuci without an anchor; it is now Yuci with a documented sabotage event."
        },
        "extensions": {
