        "description": {
          "zh": "1941 年 3 月 15 日日军自南昌进攻上高，中国军队诱敌深入并反击，4 月 9 日日军退回南昌。原线终点南昌无后续，现由「日军退回南昌」事件承接。",
          "en": "On 15 March 1941 the Japanese attacked Shanggao from Nanchang; the Chinese army drew them in and counter-attacked, and the Japanese withdrew to Nanchang on 9 April. The former line ended at Nanchang without a follow-through; the withdrawal event now supplies it."
