          "zh": "1941 年 5 月 7 日日军进攻中条山，中国军队突围，6 月中旬部分部队南渡黄河退抵洛阳、新安一带。原线终点洛阳无后续，现由「中条山突围部队退抵洛阳」事件承接。",
          "en": "On 7 May 1941 the Japanese attacked the Zhongtiao mountains; the Chinese army broke out and in mid-June part of it crossed the Yellow River south to Luoyang and Xin’an. The former line ended at Luoyang without a follow-through; the withdrawal event now supplies it."
