          "zh": "鄂西会战（中国军队增援与反击）",
          "en": "Battle of West Hubei (Chinese Reinforcement and Counterattack)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1943 年 5 月 5 日日军自荆州、石首南犯，第六战区自恩施方向调兵增援，在石牌、渔洋关一线阻击，6 月日军退回。原线起点恩施无前置，现由「第六战区自恩施增援鄂西」事件承接。",
          "en": "On 5 May 1943 the Japanese moved south from Jingzhou and Shishou; the 6th War Area sent troops from the Enshi direction, holding at Shipai and Yuyangguan, and the Japanese withdrew in June. The former line began at Enshi without a precedent; the reinforcement event now supplies it."
        },
