          "en": "Western Yunnan Counteroffensive (Chinese Eastern Axis)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1944 年 5 月 11 日中国远征军自保山强渡怒江，东线攻松山、龙陵；1945 年 1 月 27 日攻克畹町，与驻印军在芒友会师，滇西反攻结束。原线两端分别距保山、畹町无锚点，现由「远征军自保山强渡怒江」「攻克畹町」两事件承接。",
          "en": "On 11 May 1944 the Chinese expeditionary force crossed the Salween from Baoshan and attacked Songshan and Longling on the eastern axis; Wanding fell on 27 January 1945, linking with the India-based force at Mangyou and ending the western Yunnan counter-offensive. Both ends now have anchor events (the Salween crossing and the capture of Wanding)."
